    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d570">

                <pb facs="0677" n="667" sameAs="frus:frus1948v08/pg667"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.50 Recovery/12–3048</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Director of the Office of Far
                        Eastern Affairs</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Butterworth</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1948-12-30">December 30, 1948</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Unless I hear from you to the contrary, I will continue to proceed on the basis
                    that the attached memorandum accurately reflects the President’s wishes.<anchor
                        n="8" xml:id="d570-f1"/></p>
                <p>Mr. Labouisse and I had a talk this afternoon with Mr. Henderson and we are
                    meeting tomorrow morning with Mr. Cleveland.</p>
                <closer><signed>W. W[<hi rendition="#small-caps">alton</hi>] B[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">utterworth</hi>]</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d570-a1.xml" xpointer="d570-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
